        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    two_year_rate = 0.045\n    current_one_year_rate = 0.030\n\n    # Calculate the expected one-year rate next year\n    future_one_year_rate = (\n        (1 + two_year_rate) ** 2 / (1 + current_one_year_rate)\n    ) - 1\n\n    # Convert to percentage and round to two decimal places\n    answer = round(future_one_year_rate * 100, 2)\n\n    # Return answer\n    return answer\n```",
